      "body": "I couldn't find mention of dropout neither in documentation of [WordPiece](https://huggingface.co/docs/tokenizers/api/models#tokenizers.models.WordPiece) model nor [WordPieceTrainer](https://huggingface.co/docs/tokenizers/api/trainers#tokenizers.trainers.WordPieceTrainer)\nAlso I couldn't instantiate either of those classes with parameter dropout, I always get warning `Ignored unknown kwargs option dropout`.\n\nWhat is the proper way to specify a dropout for the WordPiece tokenizer?",
